        "TileImage": "$($repository 8b29da09-461f-44d7-9042-d4fde829b9f2).Image",
        "Description": "There appears to be a secret rivalry between Agents Banner and Montgomery. Banner prefers working alone while Montgomery occasionally teases him for being a lone wolf and weaker assassin. \r\rHugo Großer acts like he’s afraid of the bikers when in fact he is jealous of how successful their cocaine operation is and wants a taste of the action. Show these 3 the consequences of their sins. \r\rGive everyone else a show to remember.\r\rCreated by : ColdDayInHell (XBOX) a member of the hitmanforum.",
